  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This will provide specialised technical assistance to leadership and key officials in the Ministry of Finance and Economic Affairs (MoF), Reserve Bank of Malawi (RBM) and related Ministries, Departments and Agencies (MDAs). It will also support actors from civil society, media and the private sector to engage and constructively influence macro-economic and business environment reform processes.</narrative>
